{"seq":76,"slug":"webassembly-toolchains-platforms","title":"WebAssembly 技术体系","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms","rating":{"composite":4.22,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"webassembly-技术体系\">WebAssembly 技术体系</h1><p>WebAssembly（简称 Wasm）是一种可移植、体积小、加载快的二进制指令格式。它最初为浏览器设计，目标是让 C/C++/Rust 等语言编译的代码在 Web 上以接近原生的速度运行。到 2026 年，Wasm 已远远超越浏览器沙箱的边界——借助 WASI（WebAssembly System Interface）和 Component Model，它正在成为跨平台的通用执行层，覆盖服务器、边缘计算、IoT 和插件系统等场景。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦 WebAssembly 的核心规范、工具链、浏览器集成与浏览器外生态四个维度，从指令格式的底层机制到生产级边缘部署的完整技术栈进行系统梳理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工\">与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Web Workers 与并行计算</strong>（<code>70_frontend-web-workers-parallelism</code>）：专注浏览器多线程编程模型（Worker 类型、消息传递、SharedArrayBuffer），本 hub 仅在 Wasm 线程提案与 Worker 结合时引用其内容。</li>\n<li><strong>WebGL / Canvas 渲染</strong>（<code>72_frontend-webgl-canvas-rendering</code>）：专注 GPU 图形管线与 2D/3D 渲染 API，本 hub 在讨论 Wasm 驱动的渲染引擎（Figma、游戏引擎）时与其交叉。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 不重复讲解 Worker 通信细节或 WebGL 着色器编写，而是聚焦 Wasm 模块本身的编译、加载、执行与系统集成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A（Web 开发者，快速上手）：</strong> 基础篇第 1 篇（核心概念）→ 工具链篇第 1 篇（Rust 工具链）→ Web 集成篇（全部三篇）→ 按兴趣深入边缘计算或 Component Model。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B（系统/后端开发者，关注浏览器外）：</strong> 基础篇全部 → 工具链篇第 1、2 篇 → 浏览器外篇全部（WASI → Component Model → 边缘计算）。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C（全栈深度研究）：</strong> 按章节顺序从头到尾阅读，基础 → 工具链 → Web 集成 → 浏览器外。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>至少一门系统级语言的基础概念（Rust/C/C++ 的内存模型、编译流程）</li>\n<li>JavaScript 与浏览器 API 的基本理解</li>\n<li>了解二进制格式与虚拟机概念有助于理解执行模型，但非硬性要求</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wasm-core-concepts","title":"WebAssembly 核心概念与模块结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/foundations/wasm-core-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-and-execution","title":"线性内存与执行模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/foundations/memory-and-execution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"type-system-and-proposals","title":"类型系统扩展与标准提案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/foundations/type-system-and-proposals"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"toolchains","title":"工具链篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/toolchains","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rust-wasm-toolchain","title":"Rust 到 WebAssembly 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/toolchains/rust-wasm-toolchain"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-language-compilation","title":"多语言 WebAssembly 编译方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/toolchains/multi-language-compilation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization-and-debugging","title":"WebAssembly 优化与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/toolchains/optimization-and-debugging"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"web-integration","title":"Web 集成篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"js-wasm-interop","title":"JavaScript 与 WebAssembly 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/js-wasm-interop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"threading-and-workers","title":"Wasm 线程与 Web Workers 协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/threading-and-workers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"browser-use-cases","title":"浏览器生产案例与框架集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/browser-use-cases"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"beyond-web","title":"浏览器外篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wasi-system-interface","title":"WASI：WebAssembly 系统接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/wasi-system-interface"},{"seq":2,"slug":"component-model-and-wit","title":"Component Model 与 WIT 接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/component-model-and-wit"},{"seq":3,"slug":"edge-and-serverless","title":"边缘计算与 Serverless 中的 WebAssembly","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/edge-and-serverless"}]}]}